        CompanionComputeRpiCm5["CompanionComputeRpiCm5<br/>RPI CM5004032 and OC Master<br/>• serialFc (INOUT)<br/>• ethSwitch (INOUT)<br/>• esadOcControl (INOUT)"]
    end

    subgraph Tier_4 ["Tier 4 - Payload RF and ESAD"]
